{"seq":38,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"corrected","target":{"type":"article","id":"a0858"},"reason":"The English article called Australia's Aboriginal peoples 'Aborigines', a term Cambridge and Australian usage now treat as offensive; the sentence and table now say 'Aboriginal Australians', all three bodies note that the older English word is considered offensive, and the notes accept the old term as an answer.","by":"provenance-research","sources":[{"url":"https://dictionary.cambridge.org/dictionary/english/aborigine"},{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aboriginal_Australians"}],"changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",668],["-","Australia's"],["+","Aboriginal"],["=",1],["-","Aborigines,"],["+","Australians,"],["=",85],["-","peoples\","],["+","peoples\""],["=",1],["+","– the older \"Aborigines\" is now widely considered offensive – "],["=",298],["-","Aborigines"],["+","Aboriginal"],["=",1],["+","Australians "],["=",95]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",720],["-","peoples“,"],["+","peoples“"],["=",1],["+","– das ältere englische „Aborigines“ gilt dort heute vielfach als abwertend – "],["=",361]]},{"field":"bodyRu","diff":[["=",714],["-","пролива»,"],["+","пролива»"],["=",1],["+","(английское слово «Aborigines» там сегодня многие считают оскорбительным), "],["=",363]]},{"field":"notesEn","old":"","new":"The older term \"Aborigines\" is also accepted, although in Australia it is now widely considered offensive."},{"field":"notesDe","old":"","new":"Auch „Aboriginal Australians“ bzw. „australische Ureinwohner“ ist richtig; im australischen Englisch gilt „Aborigines“ heute vielfach als abwertend."},{"field":"notesRu","old":"","new":"Принимается и ответ «австралийские аборигены» или «коренные австралийцы»; в австралийском английском слово «Aborigines» сегодня многие считают оскорбительным."}],"hash":"6b5a484d93d2","actor":{"kind":"agent","name":"provenance-research"},"run":"provenance-research-2026-10-23","chain":"5a4b7689407f144660d48ae45a24b1eea165dbd59da98a7673e6f6d274